\v 19 So my¦146735 dear¦146736 \add ≈brothers¦146734 and¦146734 sisters¦146734\add*, note this: Everyone should¦146739 be¦146739 quick¦146743 to¦146746 listen¦146746 but slow¦146747 to¦146750 speak¦146750, and should be slow¦146751 to¦146752 \add ≈get angry¦146753\add*
