\v 22 Don't¦146788 delude¦146792 yourselves by just listening¦146790 to the¦146786 message¦146786, but¦146787 put it into practice \add in your daily lives\add*.
\v 23 Anyone¦146796 who is¦146799 just¦146803 a¦146797 listener¦146797 of¦146798 the¦146798 message¦146798 and¦146800 does nothing with it is¦146804 like¦146804 someone who looks at their face¦146809 in¦146813 a¦146814 mirror¦146814
