\v 1 My¦146905 dear \add ≈brothers¦146904 and¦146904 sisters¦146904\add*, as you live out your faith¦146911 in our¦146914 honoured \nd master¦146913 Yeshua¦146915 the¦146916 messiah¦146916\nd*, don't¦146906 show favouritism¦146908 to others.
