\v 8 However¦147042 if¦147041 you¦147044 are¦147044 obeying the¦147048 golden law¦147043, then when you¦147050 love¦147050 your¦147053 neighbour¦147052 as¦147054 yourself¦147055,\x + \xo 2:8: \xt Lev 19:18.\x* you'll¦147061 be¦147061 doing¦147061 well¦147060 according¦147047 to¦147047 the \add #scriptures¦147049\add*.
