\v 11 The¦147091 same \add @God\add* who said¦147093, ‘Don't¦147094 commit¦147096 adultery¦147096,’ also¦147099 said, ‘Don't¦147100 murder¦147102,’\x + \xo 2:11: a \xt Exo 20:14; Deu 5:18; \xo b \xt Exo 20:13; Deu 5:17.\x* so¦147105 if¦147104 you're¦147107 not¦147106 committing¦147107 adultery¦147107 but¦147111 you¦147109 murder¦147109 someone, then you've¦147112 broken the¦147116 law¦147116.
