\v 14 My¦147147 \add ≈fellow¦147146 believers¦147146\add*, what¦147143 would I gain¦147145 if¦147148 I said¦147150 that someone¦147151 had¦147153 faith but¦147155 it didn't¦147156 alter how they live their life? Faith like that wouldn't be¦147158 able¦147160 to¦147163 save¦147163 them.
\v 15 If¦147165 a¦147167 fellow believer is¦147171 lacking¦147174 clothes or food¦147178,
\v 16 and¦147182 one of you says¦147180 to¦147185 them¦147185, ‘Go¦147188 in¦147190 peace¦147191 and be¦147192 warm¦147192 and¦147194 satisfied¦147195,’ but¦147199 don't¦147197 help with their¦147203 physical needs, what¦147205 use would that be¦147205?
\v 17 In other words, faith¦147211 without the corresponding lifestyle is¦147214 just dead¦147217.
