\v 18 No doubt someone¦147223 will¦147222 say¦147222, ‘Well you¦147224 have the faith¦147225 and¦147228 I¦147228 do the good deeds¦147229.’ So show¦147231 me¦147233 your¦147236 faith¦147235 without¦147237 good deeds¦147240 and¦147242 I'll¦147242 demonstrate my faith \em by¦147246\em* my¦147249 good deeds.
