\v 25 Similarly¦147352 the¦147356 prostitute¦147357 Rahab¦147355 was made right by¦147359 \add &her\add* actions¦147360 when she welcomed¦147362 the¦147363 \add Hebrew\add* messengers¦147365 and¦147366 then helped them get away by¦147367 a different¦147367 route.\x + \xo 2:25: \xt Josh 2:1-21.\x*
