\v 1 My¦147392 \add ≈brothers¦147391 and¦147391 sisters¦147391\add*, not everyone should desire to be a teacher because we know¦147393 that¦147394 us teachers¦147389 \add ≈will¦147397 be¦147397 judged¦147396\add* more strictly.
\v 2 We all stumble in¦147398 many¦147398 ways¦147398. If¦147402 there was¦147407 someone¦147403 who never said anything wrong, this¦147408 person¦147410 would be¦147410 perfect¦147409 and also¦147414 able to have self-control over their entire¦147415 body¦147417.
