\v 4 Similarly, even huge¦147452 ships¦147450 that are being¦147453 driven¦147459 on by¦147455 strong winds¦147457 are¦147460 controlled by¦147461 a small rudder¦147463 and can be steered wherever¦147464 the¦147466 captain desires.
