\v 6 and¦147491 the¦147492 tongue¦147493 is¦147493 a¦147494 fire¦147494 producing a torrent of¦147498 depravity. It's a part¦147506 of \add &our\add* physical body¦147513 but capable of¦147507 staining¦147510 us all¦147511 over and¦147514 setting¦147515 our worlds¦147496 on¦147515 fire¦147515, because the tongue itself is¦147522 set¦147522 on¦147522 fire¦147522 from hell.
